{"root_text": {"uid": "ja1", "lang": "si", "is_root": false, "title": "අපණ්ණක ජාතකය", "author": "A.P. de Zoysa", "author_short": "Zoysa", "author_uid": "zoysa", "next": {"author_uid": "zoysa", "lang": "si", "name": "The Sandy Track ", "uid": "ja2"}, "previous": null, "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n<meta charset='UTF-8'>\n<meta name='author' content='A.P. de Zoysa'>\n<title></title>\n</head>\n<body>\n<article id='ja1' lang='si'>\n<header>\n<ul>\n<li class='division'>ඛුද්දකනිකාය</li>\n<li class='subdivision'>ජාතක</li>\n<li>(පඨමො භාගො)</li>\n<li>1. එකක නිපාතය</li>\n<li class='vagga'>1. අපණ්ණක වර්ගය</li>\n</ul>\n<h1>1. අපණ්ණක ජාතකය</h1>\n</header>\n<p class='namo'>නමො තස්ස භගවතො අරහතො සම්මාසම්බුද්ධස්ස</p>\n<p><a class='ref msdiv' id='msdiv1' href='#msdiv1'>Msdiv 1</a>බොධිසත්ව ආදී ඇතැම් පණ්ඩිත මනුෂ්‍යයෝ අවිරුද්ධවූ කාරණය කීවාහුය. තර්ක කොට ගන්නාහු විරුද්ධවූ දෙවෙනි කාරණය කියති. නුවණැත්තේ විරුද්ධවූද අවිරුද්ධවූද මේ කාරණය දැක යමක් අවිරුද්ධ නම් එය ගන්නේයයි (වදාළහ.)</p>\n<p class='endsutta'>අපණ්ණකජාතකං පඨමං.</p>\n<footer>\n<p><span class='author'>AP de Zoysa</span> edition.</p>\n<p>Permission to publish was kindly granted by Kumari Jayawardhana.</p>\n<p>Digital files were kindly supplied by Sirisumana Godage of <a href='http://www.godage.com/'>Godage International Publishing</a>, who publish a print edition of this text.</p>\n<p>Conversion from PDF was by Janaka of <a href='http://pitaka.lk/'>http://pitaka.lk/</a>.</p>\n<p>The assistance of Amaradasa Liyanagamage, Ven Mettavihari and Maithri Panagoda is gratefully acknowledged.</p>\n<p>Prepared for SuttaCentral by <span class='editor'>Ayya Kathrin Vimalañāṇī</span>.</p>\n</footer>\n</article>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}, "translation": {"uid": "ja1", "lang": "si", "is_root": false, "title": "අපණ්ණක ජාතකය", "author": "A.P. de Zoysa", "author_short": "Zoysa", "author_uid": "zoysa", "next": {"author_uid": "zoysa", "lang": "si", "name": "The Sandy Track ", "uid": "ja2"}, "previous": null, "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n<meta charset='UTF-8'>\n<meta name='author' content='A.P. de Zoysa'>\n<title></title>\n</head>\n<body>\n<article id='ja1' lang='si'>\n<header>\n<ul>\n<li class='division'>ඛුද්දකනිකාය</li>\n<li class='subdivision'>ජාතක</li>\n<li>(පඨමො භාගො)</li>\n<li>1. එකක නිපාතය</li>\n<li class='vagga'>1. අපණ්ණක වර්ගය</li>\n</ul>\n<h1>1. අපණ්ණක ජාතකය</h1>\n</header>\n<p class='namo'>නමො තස්ස භගවතො අරහතො සම්මාසම්බුද්ධස්ස</p>\n<p><a class='ref msdiv' id='msdiv1' href='#msdiv1'>Msdiv 1</a>බොධිසත්ව ආදී ඇතැම් පණ්ඩිත මනුෂ්‍යයෝ අවිරුද්ධවූ කාරණය කීවාහුය. තර්ක කොට ගන්නාහු විරුද්ධවූ දෙවෙනි කාරණය කියති. නුවණැත්තේ විරුද්ධවූද අවිරුද්ධවූද මේ කාරණය දැක යමක් අවිරුද්ධ නම් එය ගන්නේයයි (වදාළහ.)</p>\n<p class='endsutta'>අපණ්ණකජාතකං පඨමං.</p>\n<footer>\n<p><span class='author'>AP de Zoysa</span> edition.</p>\n<p>Permission to publish was kindly granted by Kumari Jayawardhana.</p>\n<p>Digital files were kindly supplied by Sirisumana Godage of <a href='http://www.godage.com/'>Godage International Publishing</a>, who publish a print edition of this text.</p>\n<p>Conversion from PDF was by Janaka of <a href='http://pitaka.lk/'>http://pitaka.lk/</a>.</p>\n<p>The assistance of Amaradasa Liyanagamage, Ven Mettavihari and Maithri Panagoda is gratefully acknowledged.</p>\n<p>Prepared for SuttaCentral by <span class='editor'>Ayya Kathrin Vimalañāṇī</span>.</p>\n</footer>\n</article>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}, "segmented": false, "suttaplex": {"acronym": "Ja 1", "alt_acronym": null, "volpages": "PTS 1.104", "alt_volpages": null, "uid": "ja1", "blurb": "This discourse regarding Truth was delivered by the Blessed One, while he was dwelling in the Great Monastery at Jetavana near Savatthi. But who, you ask, was it that led up to this tale?", "difficulty": null, "original_title": "Apaṇṇakajātaka", "root_lang": "pli", "root_lang_name": "Pāli", "type": "leaf", "from": null, "translated_title": "අපණ්ණක ජාතකය", "translations": [{"lang": "de", "lang_name": "Deutsch", "is_root": false, "author": "Sabbamitta", "author_short"